    "description": "<h3>Bi\u1EBFn AI Agent th\xE0nh X\u01B0\u1EDFng Phim Ho\u1EA1t H\xECnh 3D Roblox R6 ho\xE0n to\xE0n t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng</h3><p><b>Roblox-3D-Animation</b> l\xE0 b\u1ED9 Skill AI Agent \u0111\xF3ng g\xF3i s\u1EB5n 100% (<b>Blender 4.2+/5.x EEVEE + AgX + Python + FFmpeg</b>) d\xE0nh cho <b>Claude, ChatGPT, Claude Code, Codex v\xE0 Antigravity</b>. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n \u0111\u01B0a 1 \xFD t\u01B0\u1EDFng c\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n (Noob vs Pro vs Hacker, th\u1EED th\xE1ch S\xE0n Nh\xE0 Dung Nham, ti\u1EC3u ph\u1EA9m h\xE0i h\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng...), AI Agent t\u1EF1 vi\u1EBFt k\u1ECBch b\u1EA3n 5 h\u1ED3i, l\u1ED3ng ti\u1EBFng \u0111a nh\xE2n v\u1EADt (Ti\u1EBFng Vi\u1EC7t / Ti\u1EBFng Anh), d\u1EF1ng ph\xF2ng 3D &amp; c\u1EA3nh ph\u1ED1, di\u1EC5n ho\u1EA1t nh\xE2n v\u1EADt R6 kh\xF4ng g\xE3y kh\u1EDBp, quay camera OTS POV, gh\xE9p nh\u1EA1c n\u1EC1n 2 t\xE2m tr\u1EA1ng + 25 SFX + ph\u1EE5 \u0111\u1EC1 \u0111\u1ED9ng v\xE0 xu\u1EA5t th\u1EB3ng file <code>final.mp4</code> chu\u1EA9n <b>-14.0 LUFS</b> \u2014 kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n m\u1EDF giao di\u1EC7n Blender k\xE9o tay.</p><h3>Tr\u1ECDn b\u1ED9 t\xE0i s\u1EA3n 3D \u0111\xF3ng g\xF3i s\u1EB5n (kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n t\u1EA3i th\xEAm asset ngo\xE0i)</h3><ul><li><b>Rig Roblox R6 chu\u1EA9n 16 x\u01B0\u01A1ng (<code>roblox_r6_master.blend</code>):</b> T\u1EF7 l\u1EC7 chu\u1EA9n Roblox stud (<code>5.1</code> stud), v\xE1t c\u1EA1nh s\u1EAFc n\xE9t, UV <code>585\xD7559</code> chu\u1EA9n qu\u1EA7n \xE1o Roblox, k\xE8m kho\xE1 gi\u1EA3i ph\u1EABu c\u1EE9ng <code>ANATOMY_LIMITS</code> ch\u1ED1ng g\xE3y ng\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EA7u g\u1ED1i/khu\u1EF7u tay 100%.</li><li><b>Kho nh\xE2n v\u1EADt c\u1EF1c phong ph\xFA:</b> <b>28 bi\u1EC3u c\u1EA3m khu\xF4n m\u1EB7t</b> comic \u0111\u1ED9 ph\xE2n gi\u1EA3i <code>1024\xD71024</code> \u0111\u1ED5i tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp theo t\u1EEBng khung h\xECnh (<code>faceAt</code>), <b>18 b\u1ED9 qu\u1EA7n \xE1o Hi-Res</b> (10 \xE1o + 8 qu\u1EA7n, g\u1ED3m c\u1EA3 \xE1o Hacker Matrix ph\xE1t s\xE1ng), <b>11 ki\u1EC3u t\xF3c &amp; ph\u1EE5 ki\u1EC7n 3D</b> (5 m\u1EABu t\xF3c PBR ch\xEDnh th\u1EE9c + 6 m\u1EABu t\xF3c/m\u0169 tr\xF9m/m\u0169 l\u01B0\u1EE1i trai/r\xE2u nhu\u1ED9m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1ECDi m\xE0u).</li><li><b>Quy tr\xECnh 8 pha t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng &amp; C\u1ED5ng ki\u1EC3m duy\u1EC7t h\xECnh \u1EA3nh:</b> B\u1ED9 template <code>starter/</code> + <b>10 script Python/Blender</b> ch\u1EA1y m\u01B0\u1EE3t tr\xEAn Windows/macOS/Linux, t\u1EF1 d\u1EF1ng \u1EA3nh ki\u1EC3m duy\u1EC7t <code>stills_sheet.jpg</code> &amp; g\xF3c quay qua vai (OTS POV) \u0111\u1ECDc r\xF5 m\xE0n h\xECnh laptop/\u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi render song song an to\xE0n VRAM.</li><li><b>D\u1EF1 \xE1n m\u1EABu ho\xE0n ch\u1EC9nh 42.6 gi\xE2y \u0111i k\xE8m:</b> K\xE8m to\xE0n b\u1ED9 file ngu\u1ED3n &amp; Video Demo Full HD 1080\xD71920 <b>Floor Is Lava (Noob vs Pro vs Hacker vs Mom)</b> \u0111\u1EA1t <code>-14.20 LUFS</code>, <code>0</code> khung \u0111en.</li></ul><h3>Giao h\xE0ng ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c sau thanh to\xE1n</h3><p>Nh\u1EADn ngay <b>Link Google Drive t\u1EA3i tr\u1ECDn b\u1ED9 Core-Kit ZIP (20 MB, 152 file) + Video Demo 1080p g\u1ED1c + H\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn ti\u1EBFng Vi\u1EC7t</b> g\u1EEDi th\u1EB3ng qua Gmail &amp; T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n, \u0111\u1ED3ng th\u1EDDi k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i 1 l\u1EA7n v\xE0o AI Agent tr\xEAn trang <b>S\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m c\u1EE7a t\xF4i</b> \u0111\u1EC3 d\xF9ng ngay.</p>",
    "features": '["AI Agent t\u1EF1 d\u1EF1ng tr\u1ECDn g\xF3i phim ho\u1EA1t h\xECnh 3D Roblox R6 (9:16 TikTok/Reels/Shorts ho\u1EB7c 16:9 YouTube)", "\u0110\xF3ng g\xF3i s\u1EB5n Rig R6 16 x\u01B0\u01A1ng, 28 bi\u1EC3u c\u1EA3m khu\xF4n m\u1EB7t, 18 qu\u1EA7n \xE1o Hi-Res & 11 ki\u1EC3u t\xF3c/ph\u1EE5 ki\u1EC7n 3D", "Kho\xE1 gi\u1EA3i ph\u1EABu c\u1EE9ng ANATOMY_LIMITS (kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD g\xE3y ng\u01B0\u1EE3c kh\u1EDBp) + g\xF3c quay OTS POV r\xF5 n\xE9t", "T\u1EF1 l\u1ED3ng ti\u1EBFng \u0111a nh\xE2n v\u1EADt Edge-TTS (Ti\u1EBFng Vi\u1EC7t & Ti\u1EBFng Anh), t\u1EA1o nh\u1EA1c n\u1EC1n, 25 SFX, ph\u1EE5 \u0111\u1EC1 \u0111\u1ED9ng & master -14 LUFS", "Ch\u1EA1y m\u01B0\u1EE3t Blender 4.2+ / 5.x mi\u1EC5n ph\xED tr\xEAn Windows, macOS, Linux (t\u1ED1i \u01B0u s\u1EB5n cho GPU 4GB+)", "K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i 1 ch\u1EA1m v\u1EDBi Claude / ChatGPT / Codex / Antigravity + Link Google Drive tr\u1ECDn b\u1ED9 Core-Kit & Video Demo 1080p"]',
